  "body_html": "<p>Celebrate the most wonderful time of the year with Jeminise's Cozy Christmas Quilt. This beautifully designed quilt blends warmth with festive holiday spirit, crafted from premium microfiber for unmatched softness and comfort. It's the perfect way to add a cheerful touch to your home decor or share as a thoughtful gift with loved ones.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Festive Holiday Design:</strong> Features bright, high-quality Christmas prints to create a warm, joyful atmosphere in any room.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Comfort:</strong> Made from soft, lightweight microfiber, ensuring warmth in winter and coolness in warmer months for year-round versatility.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to fit beds, sofas, or as a decorative seasonal quilt.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> A cozy and meaningful present for Christmas, New Year, birthdays, anniversaries, or other holiday celebrations.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable with cold water on a gentle cycle, tumble dry low or air dry, and designed to be fade-resistant and wrinkle-free.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Component:</strong> Each purchase includes one festive Quilt.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Christmas Quilt-ds07</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine washable with cold water on gentle cycle. Tumble dry low or air dry.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
